      "startVerse": 0,
      "endVerse": 0,
      "author": "Tried By Fire",
      "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
      "text": "Our hope (and goal from what I can gather) in this gospel message is to get the overall picture of Jesus' ministry and purpose in a simple, quick, and painless account for the most simple-minded person to read. There is not much in this account that makes you wonder (some words perhaps that should be clarified a bit more), but it's all pretty straightforward as to who Jesus is and what He came here for.",
      "likes": 0,
      "isLikedByUser": false,
