      "author": "Tried By Fire",
      "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
      "text": "There is an interesting note added here about Mary. We were not told that she had “seven devils.” She was cleansed of being possessed and stayed persistent with the Lord all the way through. She was proof of His miracle work. She was proof that faith in the Lord is the cure for a sin-sick lifestyle. She was genuine proof of a changed life. No one would be able to deny her testimony, and therefore when she went to tell them the truth, they should have had no problem believing her.",
