      "endVerse": 11,
      "author": "Tried By Fire",
      "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
      "text": "The other disciples were present, but the angel instructed her to go see Peter along with the other disciples. Peter, however, did not believe he could be redeemed again. He thought he had lost his chance at salvation. Clearly, Jesus was not done with him yet. If we believe this is Peter’s account of the gospel story, we can be assured that Peter changes course and lives in forgiveness. However, none of the disciples believe at this moment. They are not going to take Mary’s word for it. But something sparked in Peter and John, and they are seen getting up to go check the grave.",
      "likes": 0,
