      "chapter": 16,
      "verse": 10,
      "startVerse": 10,
      "endVerse": 11,
      "author": "Tried By Fire",
      "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
      "text": "Peter doesn't understand what was happening. How did this take place? What happened to Jesus' body? What is he supposed to do now? John's account gives a slightly different viewpoint here:",
