          "author": "Tried By Fire",
          "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
          "text": "The gospels are carefully considered historical proofs of scripture. When there is a man who comes to you and says, \"How do you know Jesus existed?\" Well, these eyewitness accounts would be an acclimation to that. There is a lot of debate about who wrote what book, but I am going to trust the research, study, and time dedicated by far smarter people than me to assume they are right to address the authors.",
          "likes": 0,
