          "endVerse": 0,
          "author": "Tried By Fire",
          "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
          "text": "I think it's sufficient to give some background understanding of Mark before going further, so we know his testimony is true. He is the cousin of Barnabas (a man that was extremely helpful to Paul's ministry in the beginning).",
